      "message": "fix(slot): judge a whole-part Slot by the part's depth law\n\nA Slot whose source is the whole finished part (SrcRef::Entity) took\nDepthLaw::None, so a typed slot through the part's wall posted with no\ngouge warning. Every Slot on a part-solid source now takes\nDepthLaw::Section; a Stock source stays unjudged.\n\nFixes #1537\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
